n be created.\n\nIn the fourth test case, Vihaan can perform the following operations: \n\n -  Move the section at position $3$ to position $1$:$$1$\n\n-  Move the section at position $4$ to position $3$:$$1$\n\n-  Move the section at position $5$ to position $3$:$$1$\n\nThus, the entire road can be made flat.\n\nIn the fifth test case, Vihaan can first move the section at position $2$ to position $1$:\n\n$$1$\n\nThen, he can move the section at position $4$ to position $2$:\n\n$$1$\n\nThus, the entire road can be made flat.	[{"input": "8\\n5\\n5 5 5 9 8\\n6\\n6 6 6 6 6 6\\n5\\n5 6 7 8 9\\n5\\n9 7 12 10 12\\n4\\n4 7 5 8\\n7\\n14 9 14 12 8 11 12\\n5\\n1000000000 1000000000 1000000000 1000000000 1000000000\\n8\\n8 8 12 8 14 10 15 13", "output": "4\\n6\\n1\\n5\\n4\\n2\\n5\\n6"}]	2026-10-29 16:43:47.093	2026-10-29 15:49:10.697	2026-10-29 16:43:47.094	256	2000
