e to finish, it will be completed in $1$ hour.\n\nIn the fourth example, Nikita spends the first hour setting up the AI, while Maxim writes $10$ lines during that time, and then during the next hour $10 + 9 \\cdot 10 = 100$ lines of code are written, so the whole project can be completed in $2$ hours.	[{"input": "10\\n1 1 1 1\\n2 1 1 5\\n3 1 1 1\\n110 10 9 1\\n54 14 1 1\\n30 8 1 13\\n6 2 1 3\\n82 4 5 7\\n200 3 2 4\\n76 211 743 432", "output": "1\\n1\\n2\\n2\\n3\\n4\\n2\\n8\\n13\\n1"}]	2026-10-29 16:35:57.898	2026-10-29 15:49:10.551	2026-10-29 16:35:57.9	512	2000
