mum length you can obtain is `5`: \n\n -  $1234\\mathbf{50} \\rightarrow 12345$; \n-  $\\mathbf{01}2345 \\rightarrow 12345$.	[{"input": "3\\n5147\\n44441\\n2194\\n5602\\n123450\\n012345", "output": "2\\n-1\\n5"}]	2026-10-29 16:37:55.188	2026-10-29 15:49:10.738	2026-10-29 16:37:55.189	512	3000
